<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Touch</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">THE DRIVER ERA, Ross Lynch, Rocky</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I'd Rather Die</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">555MejRObZWpdfFHen0djQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.820" end="00:10.630">I think I'm so tough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.630" end="00:12.130">I give no fucks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.430" end="00:13.480">And you can call my bluff</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.480" end="00:14.980">Looking for some love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.750" end="00:16.250">Off to the club</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.800" end="00:17.740">Please can you turn this up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.740" end="00:19.240">Holy in my jeans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.100" end="00:20.600">What do you mean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.370" end="00:22.080">You know we do this stuff</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.080" end="00:23.590">I think that you like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.590" end="00:25.300">If you likey we can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.300" end="00:29.640">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.640" end="00:33.770">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.770" end="00:35.970">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.970" end="00:37.770">So soft</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.770" end="00:39.510">Taste like cherry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.510" end="00:41.750">Come closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.750" end="00:43.920">Let's get heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.920" end="00:45.420">Got some moves</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.780" end="00:46.280">I could use</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.120" end="00:47.620">If you choose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.050" end="00:48.690">If you want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.690" end="00:50.190">You do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.240" end="00:50.740">Right on cue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.490" end="00:52.260">Let me show you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.260" end="00:53.760">I think I'm so tough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.670" end="00:55.170">I give no fucks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.620" end="00:56.780">And you can call my bluff</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.780" end="00:58.280">Looking for some love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.980" end="00:59.480">Off to the club</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.200" end="01:01.020">Please can you turn this up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.020" end="01:02.520">Holy in my jeans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.100" end="01:03.600">What do you mean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.320" end="01:05.490">You know we do this stuff</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.490" end="01:06.990">I think that you like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.970" end="01:08.720">If you likey we can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.720" end="01:13.040">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.040" end="01:16.850">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.850" end="01:21.000">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.000" end="01:25.620">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.620" end="01:33.620">T-t-touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.050" end="02:04.710">There's no time to waste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.710" end="02:09.040">There's no time to waste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.040" end="02:13.320">Why're you far away?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.320" end="02:18.080">Baby can't you stay?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.080" end="02:26.080">There's no time to waste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.310" end="02:52.310" /></div></body></tt>